      "writtenOn": "2020-01-10T20:36:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not too happy with this.\nYes, this might be a good naive implementation to do it. But barring the it8801 chip itself changing this register(which i hope it doesn\u0027t, right?), this driver should know what the SOVR is, since it\u0027s the one always setting it.\n\nWe should cache this value instead and use that instead of sending another transaction.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 283,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 283,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "ab90e041e67e3a47bec2c5d7a88d1932f2777591",
